<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak July jobless rises to 12.75 percent.</title>
<headline>Slovak July jobless rises to 12.75 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in Slovakia rose to 331,707 in July, or 12.75 percent of the workforce, up from 12.30 percent in June, the Slovak Labour Office said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>  SLOVAK UNEMPLOYMENT	 July 1997    JUNE 1997    July 1996</p>
<p>  Total jobless		  331,707     319,923	 321,661</p>
<p>  Percentage of workforce     12.75	 12.30	   12.50</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
